<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Treble-Boosted Plexi" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A germanium treble booster slamming the front of a 100-watt plexi: the late-60s/early-70s British lead bite. The booster cuts the bass and drives the amp's top end into a cutting, vocal crunch that thickens humbuckers and makes single coils scream. Ease the boost for rhythm." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
